  - look for specs in .llmd/ when the user names none; ask if there are several; write new specs there
  - "## Title" is an open step, same as "## [ ] Title"; ticking makes it "## [x] Title"

@README.md
  - specs go in .llmd/, with a tip on gitignoring it per repo or globally
  - steps without [ ], and prompts that don't need the spec's path

